Subject: [PATCH 03685/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for PHASE C (HARDWARE
 CONTINUITY; 1 per attached board) -- per-board reachability audit: KV260 (SSH
 reachability ONLY, never host SD card), GateMate (openFPGALoader USB detect),
 PolarFire (SSH). Honest blocked_<board>_<reason> if a board is down. Keeps
 each attached board visible per the Hardware-Task Continuity Discipline
 without burning a heavy slot during the ARC sprint.

Co-Authored-By: Codex CLI <noreply@openai.com>
